### Requisições de teste (extensão "REST Client" do VS Code)
### Clique em "Send Request" acima de cada bloco.

@base = http://localhost:3333

### Status do servidor
GET {{base}}/

### Listar baralhos (pronto)
GET {{base}}/decks

### ---------------- ROTA 1 ----------------
### Criar card válido -> 201
POST {{base}}/cards
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "O que é uma API REST?",
  "answer": "Interface que usa HTTP e recursos",
  "deckId": 1
}

### Criar card inválido -> 400
POST {{base}}/cards
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "Oi",
  "deckId": "abc"
}

### Criar card em baralho inexistente -> 404
POST {{base}}/cards
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "Pergunta válida",
  "answer": "Resposta",
  "deckId": 999
}

### ---------------- ROTA 2 ----------------
### Listar cards -> 200
GET {{base}}/cards

### ---------------- ROTA 3 ----------------
### Buscar card existente -> 200
GET {{base}}/cards/1

### Buscar card inexistente -> 404
GET {{base}}/cards/999

### Buscar com ID inválido -> 400
GET {{base}}/cards/abc

### ---------------- ROTA 4 ----------------
### Remover card -> 200
DELETE {{base}}/cards/1

### Remover card inexistente -> 404
DELETE {{base}}/cards/999

### ---------------- BÔNUS ----------------
### Registrar revisão -> 200
POST {{base}}/cards/2/review
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "grade": 4
}

### Nota inválida -> 400
POST {{base}}/cards/2/review
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "grade": 7
}
